            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bumva ijwi ry’Uhoraho Imana agendagenda mur’ iryo tongo mu gihe c’akayaga ko ku kagoroba: uwo muntu n’umugore wiwe binyegeza mu biti vyo mur’ iryo tongo, ng’Uhoraho Imana ntababone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho Imana ahamagara uwo muntu, aramubaza, at’ Uri hehe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.23.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 23:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, ati Numvise ijwi ryawe mw itongo, ndatinya, kuko ndi gusa, ndinyegeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubaza, ati Ni nde yakubariye ko wambaye ubusa? Mbega wariye kuri ca giti nakubujije kuryako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imig 28:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muntu aramwishura, at’ Umugore wampaye ngo tubane, ni we yampaye ku vya ca giti, ndarya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho Imana abaza uwo mugore, at’ Ico wakoze ico n’igiki? Uwo mugore aramwishura, at’ Inzoka yampenze, ndabirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
